  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/326/luckymap.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"410\" height=\"68\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">這是一張幸運方塊地圖，最多可供4位玩家一起遊玩。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">地圖支援1至4人共同遊玩。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">若遇任何問題，請與我們聯繫。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/327/mapp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"68\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/347/3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/345/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/346/2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p>",
